		<content type="html"><![CDATA[<p>Cela fonctionne ! </p><p>Merci infiniment pour votre aide !!!! </p><br /><p>J&#039;ai modifié le recovery.conf comme suit :&#160; </p><p>primary_conninfo =&#039;application_name=sub_test host=xatdlts4d01 port=5432&#039;</p><br /><p>Merciiiiiiiiiiiiiiiiii&#160; <img src="http://forums.postgresql.fr/img/smilies/big_smile.png" width="15" height="15" alt="big_smile" /> <img src="http://forums.postgresql.fr/img/smilies/big_smile.png" width="15" height="15" alt="big_smile" /> <img src="http://forums.postgresql.fr/img/smilies/big_smile.png" width="15" height="15" alt="big_smile" /> <img src="http://forums.postgresql.fr/img/smilies/big_smile.png" width="15" height="15" alt="big_smile" /> <img src="http://forums.postgresql.fr/img/smilies/big_smile.png" width="15" height="15" alt="big_smile" /></p>]]></content>
